{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t法國前總理德維爾潘宣布參加2027年總統選舉。<br/>\n<br/>\n德維爾潘曾經在2003年代表法國政府反對美國發動伊拉克戰爭。近年來，他因在國際事務上的一系列表態重新受到關注，尤其是在加沙戰爭問題上的立場。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯︰張萬燕\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:44:27.831163+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T17:16:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T21:17:53.936462+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T17:37:49.201162+00:00","content_hash":"99f4ebb84e66164045cec6f16407ed2f9646adf1807a0f33891239c7b2a961b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}